{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:35 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"陳豪一家五口賀年舊片翻hit  細女「海豚音」拜年引網民無限Loop  老竇被震懾表情超爆笑\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bcd90b9f4d3e6a669723c9ffb5e0b3a9/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__75.png\"/>\n<p>視帝陳豪與太太陳茵媺向來是圈中的模範夫妻。近日，他們一家昔日的賀年短片突然在Threads上再度引起熱烈討論，吸引大批網民觀看。影片中，陳豪一家五口穿上喜慶的紅色中式唐裝，在桃花背景前齊聲祝賀。期間，可愛的細女Camilla先是深深吸一口氣，隨即大聲喊出極具爆發力的「海豚音」。身旁的爸爸陳豪瞬間被女兒的尖叫聲嚇了一跳，轉頭看著女兒，一臉無奈；而二仔Nathan和大仔Aiden亦紛紛望向妹妹，場面十分逗趣。</p>\n<h2>網民讚陳豪女兒性格可愛 盡得父母真傳</h2>\n<p>這段爆笑舊片曝光後，隨即引來網民熱烈留言，紛紛表示「笑到停唔到」、「我重複睇咗十幾次留意每個人嘅表情！」及「笑死我，陳豪個樣勁疑惑」。除了陳豪的幽默表情外，網民的焦點全落在細女Camilla身上。網民一致大讚Camilla非常可愛，笑稱她「特登儲咗氣先嗌，非常有潛質練習海豚音！」。更有網民稱讚Camilla盡得父母神髓，指她「樣似媽咪，性格似爹地，大個一定好funny！」及「個女同媽咪真係餅印一樣！」，認為小孩子展現真性情最討人喜歡，長大後定能兼顧搞笑與顏值。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺於2013年在法國結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/876cb2142103272bc46799f508df2ef9/2024-06/photo-3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與老婆陳茵媺育有兩子一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1632b83e3d0ca37f614939416fbd5128/2023-12/aimeechan_official_1703629163_3266600639755678284_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺是圈中的模範家庭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbce0d84eb9a180c4b64150e2de8f9bd/2023-03/328000641_3836137789946578_8682948207698909418_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪雖然忙於工作，但一有時間便會陪家人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c155e29c735ed845ba96454103b646f8/2024-01/11_1_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大仔Aiden 5歲生日，一家五口幸福同框，當時細女Camilla仔細細已經笑得超甜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/326899a2434e96e810ce6469b1eef176/2026-11/1204.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早年陳豪兩公婆帶同手抱嘅Camilla現身街頭，BB時期嘅Camilla面珠墩肉嘟嘟超得意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56bf398a9332a95cf66c9c9902eedcef/2026-11/20171219163110_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"炎炎夏日全家總動員去沙灘玩水消暑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6673e268731e6679c775b6229041639/2026-11/aimeechan_official_106413976_266390168247257_2693405969236641973_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Aimee同Camilla母女戴上同款「超遮」太陽眼鏡，Camilla托腮甫士星味十足！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a58183c3dd8fda0d2901f809a783892/2026-11/aimeechan_official_106509198_3094171870630544_2699374005936022169_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪北上開工，都一定要透過平板電腦「無缝參與」囡囡嘅生日派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a57cecd9426836e35e32c83f0a54e2d0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2021-04-28_at_13_10_04.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"聖誕節一家人齊齊着同款紅色親子睡衣排排坐，滿載幸福氛圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6caffc15c2f4a9d46adcd7a82da4192a/2026-11/1_4_73.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪落力吸金，照顧一家五口。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/317e060ba0fd3770d43b8fbc90b7aeb2/2023-12/aimeechan_official_1703509315_3265595286553309950_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺曾曝光舊居。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2be31fe8e4f1ec190fc8fad5a583e7f9/2023-06/aimeechan_official_341309216_197791269386249_9032843663914273361_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪夫婦多次在飯廳慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36ffceb40be16c8c88548d13ba34c002/2024-11/aimee_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳曾曝光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb0a7c7dc878d68d8cb16abafcfeaffe/2022-08/167943900_490018132046558_1176051617690414902_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"房間曝光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0709720eec1ac3c2ddfd9817511567ac/2022-08/195177317_778365719713919_4219133643979451458_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺曾為小朋友學業搬屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75ce739069ec3fc82f2580030c29f930/2022-08/271237992_432106451950622_5277047275433313657_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪及陳茵媺屋企擺放大量家庭照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1519e185d1c3e211703e6394610dda8/2022-04/Screenshot_20220410_160419_com.instagram.android.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪下廚，廚房曝光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e237ee367970bf3940a6045aba554f6a/2022-12/1_1024_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"裝飾飯廳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ed8fda25a4be230b02682075648f8ca/2022-04/278052473_745541460153902_4818024570660769371_n.webp%20%282%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"飯廳旁邊有數碼鋼琴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d960a42e2e150ac4c4cd1f3ef45af5fb/2025-09/aimee_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"仲有其他樂器。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17d0af379e9cd7d7c058ce0fcc7f689f/2025-09/aimee_35.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺睡床同樣白色，更用上Hermès毛毯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/62bbf1f7411bb0aaeac7588469a34525/2025-09/aimee_51.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺睡房有一排衣櫃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/737aa1c4713ed4f529ed236824204504/2025-09/aimee_52.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪沖咖啡後，赤腳人肉送到老婆陳茵媺手上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2ebd41719b8e81ee49ecc0ccceb3d29/2025-09/aimee_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺及三名子女於新豪宅中慶祝聖誕節，可見大仔（中）越大越靚仔和新居的超高樓底。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/185fa55012160e6aec9f7fb1edc626a1/2025-12/176689676011159.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"擺放聖誕樹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/546ef27ef9fb7e7e00167686effffa97/2022-12/unknown_315057959_660089922226277_4819981865363273888_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與三名子女坐在聖誕樹前拆禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63186f1211a93db20f05a6b2b39f6495/2024-12/05001f15-1016-4e3d-b537-5435a050046a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"好大個窗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ca341529cbd1cb7f912db64b2250cce/2024-12/ceb91abe-ff9d-47ff-abca-6ac8532ba30a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在巨廳為兒子剪頭髮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/554f785c4b3a71944d220695f7cbc776/2022-12/2_1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"露台個景好靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/456fb8f8512d2b52ade5333bf4006ba6/2022-12/photo1672383758%20%282%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳的梳花多次移位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f98305cb6ff9bf58985fd0eaeadd3e89/2025-09/AIMEE_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"個廳大到可以擺大桃花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf169b9b85feee65cfdb2a576df8e8c0/2023-01/Snapinsta.app_10000000_2111738435882132_1408156490795312109_n.mp4_snapshot_00.19.400.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"室內掛有不少陳豪夫婦的結婚照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/283b07806cb011ab348178dfef0715aa/2023-01/Snapinsta.app_10000000_2111738435882132_1408156490795312109_n.mp4_snapshot_00.29.159.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪一家拜年將家中環境公開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36549818f4372b8865eed57b0d850330/2023-01/Snapinsta.app_10000000_2111738435882132_1408156490795312109_n.mp4_snapshot_00.35.196.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳豪女兒漸顯少女氣質 一家生活富裕</h2>\n<p>時至今日，Camilla已漸漸長大。早前陳茵媺分享帶女兒出遊的合照，10歲的Camilla五官精緻，與媽媽如同餅印，頗具星味。陳豪與陳茵媺夫婦近年事業順遂，一家五口已由南灣舊居，搬入位於中半山舊山頂道、月租高達16萬港元的複式豪宅，可飽覽維港海景。近年陳豪北上拍劇兼接拍廣告，陳茵媺亦活躍於名媛社交圈，一家生活優渥。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與年長10年的陳豪結婚，婚後成為幸福女人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/484a49eb5e930be7400e868b2809d20e/2024-12/464373102_1679255069533480_5043764827372704581_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與陳豪好恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4134e2685d318bab94ff4740485a1337/2023-09/13_25.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪同陳茵媺結婚多年一直恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a5feea5692d154b66031c88c79d2b7f/2022-08/MusDcIm9_7ChRy72IjcuBVaByY7bbEhtg34z6YN-M-k.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪有兩個哥哥，其中一位（後）曾被陳茵媺曝光樣貌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f87ae91bfee748cae9056f394a6e88d/2023-10/AIMEE_19.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪媽媽母兼父職照顧三子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/342ad5b30eb3d524eef85d7dc628f0c6/2023-10/AIMEE_20.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺女兒很愛公主造型。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23cc16aea9a7d52b7383112e914c01eb/2025-03/aimeechan_official_1742462039_3592354418646642608_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺仙氣爆發。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e88776720528639af2985515bdade84/2025-03/aimeechan_official_1742462039_3592354418856469408_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與女兒似足餅印。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aefbc7519e1b369a7103e2e5642bd674/2025-03/aimeechan_official_1742462039_3592354418663544935_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺女兒盡得真傳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f615c8028a1002e1bcb7a2cd75f247c0/2025-03/aimeechan_official_1742462039_3592354418797625559_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺貼上一家五口的賀年相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85010217942910f6ee86757e2dfa1777/2026-02/aimeechan_official_2026_2_19_3834490531305478062_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪三父子似足餅印。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b999e0fbbeeea0e540559693dcd0e47b/2026-02/aimeechan_official_2026_2_19_3834490543007534490_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺貼出利是封相片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9367a339bd7954ab74f1224c70833721/2026-02/aimeechan_official_2026_2_19_3834490575328882903_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原來今年的利是封由細女Camilla負責設計\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15b3df3ccf25c312f8cfba08c7602956/2026-02/aimeechan_official_2026_2_19_3834490576822065425_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家人齊齊整湯圓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4007aeb831d97b72dcc32858766b9db/2026-02/aimeechan_official_2026_2_19_3834490581309979913_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有板有眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b17a00feefbd013ba7a8828aeb1b82f0/2026-02/aimeechan_official_2026_2_19_3834490581930695177_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一盆巨大的粉色蘭花，增添了貴氣和新年氣氛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96e11d1f5f7326235343991c456cbf3f/2026-02/aimeechan_official_2026_2_19_3834490591829274498_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪家中擺放了多盆盛開的蘭花作為裝飾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d54e3104a2ae984d2af2942ca664b65/2026-02/aimeechan_official_2026_2_19_3834490594865931888_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺於2013年在法國結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64eeb9ed06968a603706ad2c59632bdb/2024-06/_66a7707.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪與陳茵媺結婚多年，恩愛如昔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/580921c69cd2a4bb4c792ec342fcb4e0/2023-01/aimee_44.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺婚後淡出幕前，由陳豪獨力養家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e40b19bea8e3a9d224e2334cae350bf5/2023-02/aimeechan_official_331169313_587659899560303_5548429869616900452_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺經常大晒恩愛，在IG貼出與陳豪手拖手的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb66d744c862a46748484b98ecba94cd/2024-10/aimeechan_official_1728904595_3478626335205456054_5380819826_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺輕倚老公肩膊，陳豪親吻老婆秀髮放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb776a3cb819fb16f9e0ca473ea28528/2024-10/aimeechan_official_1728904595_3478626335331347574_5380819826_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪近年經常到內地工作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4abe629e995f128dd989f914dab58163/2023-12/MOCHAN_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪不在港時，由陳茵媺獨自照顧仔女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a1150c31a3b3615fb3835441b734a00/2023-08/AIMEE_04.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪早前舉家外遊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ab7be0baa0d7363e9f74a7692d5f174/2023-12/aimeechan_official_1703628366_3266593957675785217_5380819826.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪的咖啡生意搵到食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a513bc90cf47f04644a391554c177c1/2024-11/aimee_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪早前為銀行拍廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97e4a44d582d87492ec0cbfa73a2ad07/2025-04/a_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳豪廣告造型型仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7e03fefd0f7e1479c687cf16607f2e4/2025-04/b_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺早前貼出3張美照，反映狀態回勇非常吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fefc5f4148224fdd74ed911836fa753/2025-03/v1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺上圍較以前更加豐滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f77c35301a2bc96198ffeecb2f8fee82/2025-03/v2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺盡展美態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f01cd77b5f42b2fa25dda3f90d7fbc33/2025-03/v3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民早前在梁圳萬像天地4樓一間售賣盲盒玩具店撞見陳茵媺與子女掃玩具。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a18b61730f03918862066de86e613b79/2024-12/tiannewanxiangtiandeouyuchenyinweitongchenhao_2_jinchaomeilijinchaozui_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"捕獲的網民大讚陳茵媺，「真人真的超級無敵漂亮」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04ed1b4fc7b96fc898246a217eb81f48/2024-12/tiannewanxiangtiandeouyuchenyinweitongchenhao_3_jinchaomeilijinchaozui_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"細女Camilla對一包包細小的玩具充滿好奇，逐一拿上手細看。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2cbc3d17eb25b458479c67da84c623dd/2024-12/tiannewanxiangtiandeouyuchenyinweitongchenhao_4_jinchaomeilijinchaozui_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺與子女揀玩具，陳豪則在旁邊默默等候老婆仔女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c2127db9462fa1c59fff3e5b4d770cf/2024-12/tiannewanxiangtiandeouyuchenyinweitongchenhao_1_jinchaomeilijinchaozui_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺有儲Labubu。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1ee1bf3cd85f580714e7fabb6268e748/2024-12/301_13.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳茵媺早前分享一輯去嘉年華的相片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7046c025cbd03d11f51ae76a0b6b4b4b/2024-12/471492718_18344090821179827_3217676251360751361_n.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T08:58:05.110100+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":659,"images":72,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T08:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T09:52:44.821959+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T08:52:00.528258+00:00","content_hash":"6a88edc8b701ffed10d45e931167a98998d59ab318b7198d20d5cd6eb1de610f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}